      {"type":"review","settings":{"rating":5,"title":"Beautiful piece of equipment","body":"It looks like furniture, not gym equipment. My partner didn't even realize it was a reformer at first. The aluminium finish is gorgeous.","author":"James L.","date":"Verified Buyer"}},
      {"type":"review","settings":{"rating":4,"title":"Solid but heavy","body":"The build quality is exceptional. Just be aware it's 68kg - you'll want a dedicated spot for it. Once placed, it's a dream to use.","author":"Michael T.","date":"Verified Buyer"}},
      {"type":"review","settings":{"rating":5,"title":"Changed my practice","body":"After 6 months of daily use I can say the spring system is the real standout. Smooth, progressive resistance that just feels right.","author":"Emma R.","date":"Verified Buyer"}},
      {"type":"qa","settings":{"q":"How long does shipping take?","a":"We ship within 2-3 business days from our Sydney warehouse. Standard delivery takes 5-7 business days to metro areas across Australia and 7-10 days to NZ. You'll receive a tracking link via email once dispatched."}},
      {"type":"qa","settings":{"q":"Do you offer Afterpay?","a":"Yes. We support Afterpay (4 interest-free payments), PayPal Pay in 4, Shop Pay Installments, and all major credit cards. All financing options are visible at checkout."}},
      {"type":"qa","settings":{"q":"What's the warranty?","a":"The frame carries a 10-year warranty covering structural defects. All springs, ropes, wheels, and upholstery carry a 2-year warranty. Full terms are in the owner's manual included with every unit."}},
      {"type":"qa","settings":{"q":"Is the RS03 suitable for beginners?","a":"Yes. The 4-spring system lets you adjust resistance from very light (beginner/rehab) to very heavy (advanced). Most beginners start with 1-2 springs and progress as their strength builds. We include a Quick Start guide with your first 10 exercises."}},
      {"type":"qa","settings":{"q":"What space do I need?","a":"The RS03 is 240 x 65 cm. Allow an extra 30cm of clearance at each end for the carriage travel and rope system. Total recommended space is approximately 240 x 125 cm with ceiling height of 220cm+ for standing exercises."}},
